{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB Plus飲食節目《美食新聞報道》昨晚（20日）一集，「美食大使」伍倩彤（Gillian）有食神，先到灣仔歎潮汕滷水火鍋，再跟蔡景行（行仔）入元朗食正宗陽澄湖爆膏大閘蟹，一次過滿足兩大願望之餘，還要「挑戰」膽固醇。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:09.707722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:24:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:57:40.581213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:38.528548+00:00","content_hash":"3e56d77043f7bd1ab455e4f8aae696f6ab5d00657e12a2dd907f6240c023923e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}